\newlabel{fig:viewer}{{3}{7}{Pipeline~2: Deer Hunter~II savanna scene rendered with our Embree-based interactive viewer. The procedural low-poly world features a player character, deer, crows, trees, ponds with reeds, and rocks---all rendered with unlit albedo, binary ground shadows, and linear distance fog fading to a warm sky}{figure.caption.12}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Pipeline~3: PBR-to-cel transition sequence. The two colored boxes in the Cornell Box are the stylization targets. At low $t$ the scene is photorealistic with GI; at high $t$ the boxes exhibit hard cel-shading boundaries while retaining color bleeding from the walls.}}{7}{figure.caption.13}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:transition}{{4}{7}{Pipeline~3: PBR-to-cel transition sequence. The two colored boxes in the Cornell Box are the stylization targets. At low $t$ the scene is photorealistic with GI; at high $t$ the boxes exhibit hard cel-shading boundaries while retaining color bleeding from the walls}{figure.caption.13}{}}
